  ('finance-overview', 'finance', 'Finance overview', 'Cash, invoices, collections and budget that explain every gap', 'Finance views for overview, reconcile, timeline, budget, cash forecast, collections, vendors and renewals, all built on reviewed sources with conserved allocations.', 'Founders & finance', 'live', 'Landmark', '/finance, finance.ts', '/home/eadev/ea-research/ux/finance/screens/01-overview-1440-dark.png', 0),
