    values (v_org, 'Solar Installer OS', 'draft', 'Residential and commercial solar installers (EPCs) in India with 10 to 150 people, a field team doing surveys and installs, and subsidy and net-metering paperwork for every customer.', 'Every lead becomes a commissioned site with photos, paperwork and payment tracked from one phone app, and the owner sees every site''s stage and cash on one screen.', 8, 7, 3, 4, '["A solar industry pack: enquiry, site survey, design, quotation, installation, net metering and commissioning as ready-made processes", "Phone field forms with geotagged photos, signatures and checklists for every site visit", "Quotations with automatic follow-ups until the customer answers", "Automatic attendance for the field team, with leave and payroll", "A customer portal for documents, stage and payments"]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Solar process pack, pre-built", "value": 60000, "why": "Survey to commissioning already mapped, so the team works the Pulse way from week one."}, {"name": "Subsidy and net-metering checklist", "value": 15000, "why": "Every document the discom asks for, attached to the right step."}, {"name": "Field-team onboarding day", "value": 25000, "why": "We set up every installer''s phone in one morning."}]'::jsonb,
      'Twenty installs guarantee: your next twenty installations run end to end in Pulse within 60 days, or we refund the launch fee.', 'Three installer launches a month per region, so field onboarding stays hands-on.', 'The launch fee is waived for installers who start before 31 January 2027, ahead of the summer installation season.', '{"magnet": "OS", "avatar": "Solar Installer", "goal": "Every site commissioned, documented and paid", "interval": "in 60 days", "container": "Pack", "tagline": "Solar Installer OS: every site commissioned, documented and paid, from one phone."}'::jsonb, '[{"label": "A site coordinator chasing photos and paperwork (per month)", "amount": 45000}, {"label": "One subsidy claim delayed by a missing document", "amount": 80000}, {"label": "CRM + field app + HRMS for 40 people (per month)", "amount": 35000}]'::jsonb, 'INR', 44999,
      'month', 'For solar installers whose sites, paperwork and payments live in WhatsApp photos and sheets, Solar Installer OS runs every installation from enquiry to commissioning on one phone app. Unlike generic CRMs, it ships with the solar process already built.', 'Practical and field-first. Show the phone, a geotagged site photo and the stage of every site. Speak in the installer''s words: survey, net metering, commissioning.', '[{"key": "installer", "name": "Installer", "price": 19999, "seats": 15, "blurb": "Leads, site visits and quotes for a growing installer.", "features": ["focus-home", "my-desk", "tasks-views", "projects", "team-chats", "chat-tasks", "pip-assistant", "team-directory", "auto-attendance", "leave-shifts", "phone-app", "desktop-app", "push-notifications", "roles-permissions", "sign-in-security", "audit-log", "command-search", "smart-notifications", "field-forms", "site-visits", "acquisition", "quote-followups", "billing-documents", "catalogue", "industry-packs", "runs", "my-steps", "processes-library"]}, {"key": "growth", "name": "Growth", "price": 44999, "seats": 50, "blurb": "Customer portal, finance, payroll and the site map.", "highlight": true, "features": ["focus-home", "my-desk", "tasks-views", "projects", "team-chats", "chat-tasks", "pip-assistant", "team-directory", "auto-attendance", "leave-shifts", "phone-app", "desktop-app", "push-notifications", "roles-permissions", "sign-in-security", "audit-log", "command-search", "smart-notifications", "field-forms", "site-visits", "acquisition", "quote-followups", "billing-documents", "catalogue", "industry-packs", "runs", "my-steps", "processes-library", "client-portal", "clients-crm", "contacts", "finance-entries", "finance-overview", "hr-desk", "payroll", "pulse-map", "team-dashboard", "flow-apps", "ai-employees"]}, {"key": "epc", "name": "EPC", "price": 99999, "seats": null, "blurb": "Several regions, finance desk, API and self-hosting.", "features": ["focus-home", "my-desk", "tasks-views", "projects", "team-chats", "chat-tasks", "pip-assistant", "team-directory", "auto-attendance", "leave-shifts", "phone-app", "desktop-app", "push-notifications", "roles-permissions", "sign-in-security", "audit-log", "command-search", "smart-notifications", "field-forms", "site-visits", "acquisition", "quote-followups", "billing-documents", "catalogue", "industry-packs", "runs", "my-steps", "processes-library", "client-portal", "clients-crm", "contacts", "finance-entries", "finance-overview", "hr-desk", "payroll", "pulse-map", "team-dashboard", "flow-apps", "ai-employees", "org-switcher", "leadership-people", "people-cost", "ca-desk", "billing-templates", "api-v1", "webhooks", "self-hosted", "module-switches"]}]'::jsonb, '#e8a100', 1, true, v_person);
